 "title": "IIMB Board | Chairperson & Director | Indian Institute of Management Bangalore",
 "text": "Board\nChairperson\nDr. Devi Prasad Shetty\n\nChairman and Founder Narayana Health\n\nchair[at]iimb[dot]ac[dot]in\n\nChairperson's Message\n\nDirector-in-charge\nU Dinesh Kumar\n\ndirector[at]iimb[dot]ac[dot]in\n\nSl.No\tName\tDesignation\n1.\tDr. Devi Prasad Shetty\tChairperson, Board of Governors, IIMB\nChairman and Founder Narayana Health\n2.\tDr. Hasmukh Adhia\tFormer Finance Secretary, Government of India\n3.\tMr. Sonjoy Chatterjee\tChairman & CEO, Goldman Sachs (India) Securities Pvt Ltd.\n4.\tProfessor Jitamitra Desai\tProfessor, IIMB\n5.\tProfessor U Dinesh Kumar\tDirector-in-charge, IIMB\n6.\tMs. Shanti Ekambaram\tDirector, Kotak Mahindra Capital Company and Director Kotak Securities Limited\n7.\tMs. Malavika R Harita\tFounder & CEO, Brand Circle, and Former CEO Saatchi Focus India\n8.\tProfessor Sreelata Jonnalagedda\tProfessor, IIMB\n9.\tProfessor Das Narayandas\tEdsel Bryant Ford Professor of Business Administration at the Harvard Business School, Boston, USA\n10.\tDr. Shalini Rajneesh, IAS\tChief Secretary, Government of Karnataka\n11.\tMr. M. D. Ranganath\tChairman, Catamaran Ventures\n12.\tMs. Kalpana Saroj\tChairperson, Kamani Tubes\n13.\tDr. K M Praphullachandra Sharma\tJoint Secretary (International Cooperation & Management)\n14.\tProfessor Raji Srinivasan\tJack R. Crosby Regents Chair in Business Administration at the Red McCombs School of Business, University of Texas at Austin, USA\n \tSpecial Invitees\n \tProfessor Venkatesh Panchapagesan\tDean (Administration), IIMB\n \tProfessor Mukta Kulkarni\tDean (Programmes), IIMB\n \tProfessor Sourav Mukherji\tDean (Faculty), IIMB\n \tProfessor Vasanthi Srinivasan\tDean (Alumni Relations and Development), IIMB\n \t\n\nThe Board, was originally constituted on March 27 1972, and last updated on 14 August, 2026.\n\n* Listed in alphabetical order of last names.\n\nInternational Advisory Committee\nProfessor\nRuth Aguilera,\n\nDarla and Frederick Brodsky Trustee Professor in Global Business; Distinguished Professor, International Business and Strategy, Northeastern University\n\nProfessor\nBharat Anand,\n\nRichard R. West Dean of NYU Stern and Professor of Business Administration\n\nProfessor\nDavid Bach,\n\nPresident of IMD and Nestlé Professor of Strategy and Political Economy\n\nProfessor\nGerry George,\n\nTamsen and Michael Brown Family Professor of Entrepreneurship and Innovation and Academic Advisor to the Georgetown Entrepreneurship Initiative\n\nProfessor\nKrishna Rajagopal,\n\nWilliam A. M. Burden Professor of Physics Margaret MacVicar Faculty Fellow\n\nProfessor\nRaghu Sundaram,\n\nSenior Vice Chancellor and Chief Global Officer, New York University\nDean Emeritus, NYU Stern Edward I. Altman Professor of Credit and Debt Markets\nProfessor of Finance\n\nProfessor\nLin Zhou,\n\nDean of The Chinese University of Hong Kong (CUHK) Business School and Choh-Ming Li\nProfessor of Economics\n\n* Last updated on August 14, 2026.\n* Listed in alphabetical order of last names.",
